{"id":"we-stellar-control","backs":"the mismatch noted in INDEX.md","source":"control: the core's 7.2921159e-5 is not the turn among the stars (expected refuted)","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":"2*pi/86164.0989","value":"7.2921159e-5","abs_tol":"5e-13"}}
