{"id":"thin-100km","backs":"README.md (within 20 %); test_orbit atmosphere (the thin rows, 0.2)","source":"the core's fit above 86 km lies within 20 % of the standard's table at 100 km, 0.8 to 1.2 times it (the table value cited, not derived)","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":"6.958e-6*exp(-(h - 86000)/5910)","vars":{"h":"100000"},"lo":"4.4832E-7","hi":"6.7248E-7"}}
