{"id":"vcirc-500km","backs":"test_invariants certified_numbers, readouts_are_derived","source":"the circular speed at 500 km, sqrt(mu/r)","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":"sqrt(3.986004418e14/(6371000 + 500000))","value":"7616.5608062629","abs_tol":"1e-9"}}
{"id":"kepler-500km","backs":"test_invariants certified_numbers","source":"Kepler's period of a round 500 km orbit, 2 pi sqrt(r^3/mu)","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":"2*pi*sqrt((6371000 + 500000)^3/3.986004418e14)","value":"5668.1443690612","abs_tol":"1e-9"}}
{"id":"kepler-as-flown","backs":"README.md (one revolution 5,669 s); test_orbit kepler_holds (5668.9 s)","source":"Kepler's period of the orbit as flown, 501.240 x 499.985 km after the thrust's tail","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":"2*pi*sqrt((6371000 + (501240.09 + 499984.83)/2)^3/3.986004418e14)","value":"5668.9","abs_tol":"0.05"}}
{"id":"ring-ahead","backs":"README.md (the Ring 25.0 km ahead)","source":"the chord of 25 km of arc on the 6,871 km orbit: the range at arrival","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":"2*(6371000 + 500000)*sin(25000/(6371000 + 500000)/2)","value":"25000","abs_tol":"0.05"}}
{"id":"hold-vrel","backs":"README.md (about 0.7 m/s); test_invariants readouts_are_derived","source":"a craft holding 650 m off the Ring's centre on its fixed axis reads n x 650 m against the frame turning with the orbit","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":"650*sqrt(3.986004418e14/(6371000 + 500000)^3)","value":"0.7205304212","abs_tol":"1e-10"}}
{"id":"qbar-800km","backs":"test_invariants vacuum_conserves (above the air)","source":"at 800 km, at any bound orbit's speed (under escape's, 2 mu / r), the fit's dynamic pressure is under 1e-7 Pa; the core pushes only above 1e-6","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":"0.5*2.5e-10*exp(-(800000 - 200000)/48300)*2*3.986004418e14/(6371000 + 800000)","lo":"0","hi":"1e-7"}}
{"id":"drag-500km","backs":"test_invariants thin_air_ledger","source":"what the thin air at 500 km takes a revolution, -1/2 rho v_air^2 S c_d v / m T, c_d 0.020, m 34,388 kg, the air turning with the Earth at 32.84 degrees","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":{"let":[["r","6371000 + 500000"],["v","sqrt(3.986004418e14/r)"],["va","v - 7.2921159e-5*r*cos(32.844*pi/180)"],["rho","2.5e-10*exp(-300000/48300)"]],"expr":"-0.5*rho*va^2*150*0.020*v/(30000 + 4387.87)*2*pi*sqrt(r^3/3.986004418e14)"},"value":"-0.0489","abs_tol":"0.0001"}}
{"id":"surface-g","backs":"INDEX.md","source":"the model's gravity at the sphere's surface, mu/RE^2: 0.14 % above standard gravity","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":"3.986004418e14/6371000^2","value":"9.82025","abs_tol":"0.000005"}}
{"id":"felt-g","backs":"test_invariants readouts_are_derived (standing); test_orbit ground_settles (1 g to 1 %)","source":"standing on the plumb-line ground at 32.92 N: gravity less the Earth's turn, in g","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":{"let":[["phi","32.91569901*pi/180"],["g","3.986004418e14/6371000^2"],["c","7.2921159e-5^2*6371000*cos(phi)"]],"expr":"sqrt(g^2 - 2*g*c*cos(phi) + c^2)/9.80665"},"value":"0.998954","abs_tol":"0.000001"}}
{"id":"plumb-angle","backs":"orbit_core.cpp gearLoad (the ground level to the plumb line)","source":"the plumb line leans 0.09 degrees from the radius at 32.92 N: square to the sphere, a parked craft would slide","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":{"let":[["phi","32.91569901*pi/180"],["g","3.986004418e14/6371000^2"],["c","7.2921159e-5^2*6371000*cos(phi)"]],"expr":"atan(c*sin(phi)/(g - c*cos(phi)))*180/pi"},"value":"0.0904","abs_tol":"0.00005"}}
{"id":"tmax","backs":"README.md (706 kN); internal.h T_MAX; test_invariants certified_numbers","source":"1.2 x the take-off weight of 60 t","cmd":"check.equal","args":{"a":"1.2*60000*9.80665","b":"706078.8"}}
{"id":"flow","backs":"test_invariants mass_bookkeeping; test_orbit rocket_equation","source":"the flow at full thrust, T/(Isp g0): g0 cancels, 36 kg/s exactly","cmd":"check.equal","args":{"a":"1.2*60000*9.80665/(2000*9.80665)","b":"36"}}
