{"id":"sun-dec-almanac","backs":"sky.cpp (-17.9 degrees); README.md","source":"the Sun's declination, 2026-11-12 at 1 pm local mean solar time at KDFW: the Astronomical Almanac's low-precision formulae (0.01 degrees)","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":{"let":[["n","9811.5 + (13 + 97.02600098/15)/24"],["L","280.460 + 0.9856474*n"],["g","357.528 + 0.9856003*n"],["lam","L + 1.915*sin(g*pi/180) + 0.020*sin(2*g*pi/180)"],["eps","23.439 - 0.0000004*n"]],"expr":"asin(sin(eps*pi/180)*sin(lam*pi/180))*180/pi"},"lo":"-17.86","hi":"-17.84"}}
{"id":"sun-dec-meeus","backs":"sky.cpp (-17.9 degrees); README.md","source":"the same by Meeus, Astronomical Algorithms, chapter 25 (0.01 degrees): an independent second method","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":{"let":[["T","(9811.5 + (13 + 97.02600098/15)/24)/36525"],["L0","280.46646 + 36000.76983*T + 0.0003032*T^2"],["M","357.52911 + 35999.05029*T - 0.0001537*T^2"],["C","(1.914602 - 0.004817*T - 0.000014*T^2)*sin(M*pi/180) + (0.019993 - 0.000101*T)*sin(2*M*pi/180) + 0.000289*sin(3*M*pi/180)"],["om","125.04 - 1934.136*T"],["lam","L0 + C - 0.00569 - 0.00478*sin(om*pi/180)"],["eps","23 + 26/60 + 21.448/3600 - (46.8150*T + 0.00059*T^2 - 0.001813*T^3)/3600 + 0.00256*cos(om*pi/180)"]],"expr":"asin(sin(eps*pi/180)*sin(lam*pi/180))*180/pi"},"lo":"-17.86","hi":"-17.84"}}
{"id":"sun-dec-core","backs":"sky.cpp (-17.9 degrees)","source":"the core's -17.9 is the declination to the nearest tenth, within 0.06 degrees","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":{"let":[["n","9811.5 + (13 + 97.02600098/15)/24"],["L","280.460 + 0.9856474*n"],["g","357.528 + 0.9856003*n"],["lam","L + 1.915*sin(g*pi/180) + 0.020*sin(2*g*pi/180)"],["eps","23.439 - 0.0000004*n"]],"expr":"asin(sin(eps*pi/180)*sin(lam*pi/180))*180/pi"},"value":"-17.9","abs_tol":"0.06"}}
{"id":"sun-dec-core-control","backs":"INDEX.md","source":"control: and not within 0.04 degrees (expected refuted): -17.9 rounds -17.85","cmd":"check.contains","args":{"expr":{"let":[["n","9811.5 + (13 + 97.02600098/15)/24"],["L","280.460 + 0.9856474*n"],["g","357.528 + 0.9856003*n"],["lam","L + 1.915*sin(g*pi/180) + 0.020*sin(2*g*pi/180)"],["eps","23.439 - 0.0000004*n"]],"expr":"asin(sin(eps*pi/180)*sin(lam*pi/180))*180/pi"},"value":"-17.9","abs_tol":"0.04"}}
